 "as_of": "2026-10-05",
 "descriptor": "Indian GPU cloud (neocloud) provider",
 "lede": "A listed Indian AI cloud that rents out NVIDIA GPUs, now about 5,100 of them, with L&T as an 18% shareholder and partner. Q1 FY27 revenue jumped 334% at a 75% EBITDA margin once B200s went live, but the business is capital hungry, FY26 was loss-making after depreciation, and management gives no guidance.",
 "market": {
  "price": 656,
